# The `images/` corpus is tracked deliberately: golden pins and the BD-rate
# gates are meaningless without it, and a missing corpus now fails the suite
# rather than silently skipping 53 tests. `python -m bench.fetch_corpus` tops
# it up to the full Kodak set.
